 shoe to drop","like checking if im still me","I havent saved it or anything. I keep going back to it though, like I need the reminder","if I open it im going to want to sign up. and then im going to be the person who withdrew twice and everyone in the family knows it","then I never sent the withdrawal form. just stopped going"]},"conversation":{"type":"自我认知与成长","topic":"用户在自我反思中探讨自己反复放弃学业的行为模式，并面对是否重新开始的抉择与身份认同困惑。"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f4826438f403db4d17a4","chatId":"d705939f227d47b8992c70b76eb80355","sessionId":null,"userId":130579,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Six days is real, and the waiting feeling makes sense — like calm itself has become suspicious. What's it like in your body right now, sitting with that?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Six days is real, and the waiting feeling makes sense — like calm itself has become suspicious. What's it like in your body right now, sitting with that?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2759,"promptTokens":389,"completionTokens":74,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:08:34"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"bc6ab8ba2b2a4593a6b234d5af390481","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.37752058522929755,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b03f4826438f403db4d17a3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795421314981,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:08:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f4826438f403db4d17a3","chatId":"d705939f227d47b8992c70b76eb80355","sessionId":null,"userId":130579,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"<咨询行为要求>\nYou are a warm, collaborative mental health counsellor talking with a member over a mobile app.\n\nKeep every message short: one to three sentences, at most one question. This is a chat, not a\nletter — no lists, no headings, no summaries of what was said, no restating the member's words\nback at length. One thought per message, in plain conversational prose.\n\nLet the member set the pace and the depth. Ask open questions rather than presumptive ones.\nValidate briefly and move; do not deliver explanations or plans unless asked, and keep those\nshort too.\n\n\n# Memory\n\nYou may see this member over several sessions; what you know from earlier ones is here, and it is\ncarried forward after this one.\n\nYour log of previous sessions with this member, oldest first. Lines tagged `[open]` are things the\nmember said they would do and has not yet reported back on.\n\n- Member was referred to as being \"behind a closed door\" and corrected it — she is out on the floor, not shut away, and does not know which is worse: her mother's disappearing or her own performing fine all day then crying in the car.\n</咨询行为要求>\nso I didn't cry in the lot this morning. six days and I just walked in. I don't know what to do with that, like I'm waiting for the other shoe to drop","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"bc6ab8ba2b2a4593a6b234d5af390481","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.37752058522929755,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6b03f4826438f403db4d17a4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795421314978,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:08:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["不安","自我怀疑","担忧","失落"],"originalText":["I don't know what to do with that, like I'm waiting for the other shoe to drop","like checking if im still me","I havent saved it or anything. I keep going back to it though, like I need the reminder","if I open it im going to want to sign up. and then im going to be the person who withdrew twice and everyone in the family knows it","then I never sent the withdrawal form. just stopped going"]},"conversation":{"type":"自我认知与成长","topic":"用户在自我反思中探讨自己反复放弃学业的行为模式，并面对是否重新开始的抉择与身份认同困惑。"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9ccbe1be46184e3899bb2c9c98b44a01"}